                    <physDesc>
                        <objectDesc>
                            <supportDesc>
                                <support><p>A block of off-white limestone, subject to alveolar weathering on the face. Intact front, right, above, and below, damaged on the left. Possibly intact to the rear. The right side is roughly worked, with a rough moulding or cornice along the upper edge. The upper surface has a semicircular depression near the front left, with the left edge forming its edge. The front face is lightly concave, deeper towards the left edge, shallower towards the outer right edge. The rear face, if intact, is cut back from the right side towards the break on the left side. The block would seem therefore to form part of a larger monument, whether a statue base or something else.</p>
                                    <material type="inorganic.stone" subtype="unverified" ref="http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/66.html">limestone</material>
                                    <objectType ana="#object.statue_base" ref="http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/57.html" cert="low">statue base</objectType>
                                    <dimensions>
                                        <height unit="cm">26</height>
                                        <width unit="cm">29 (maximum, at front)</width>
                                        <depth unit="cm">49.5 (on right)</depth>
                                    </dimensions>
                                </support>
                                <condition ana="#condition.damaged"/>
                            </supportDesc>
                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout><p>Two lines of Latin letters across the face, with vacat below. The right margin may be preserved. Line 1 is larger.</p>
                                    <rs ana="#execution.chiselled" ref="http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1">chiselled</rs>
                                    <damage ana="#text_condition.incomplete"/>
                                </layout>
                            </layoutDesc>
                        </objectDesc>
                        <handDesc>
                            <handNote><p>Simply cut letters (no clear evidence of a v-cut), very regular, even width strokes, minimal trace of serifs. P is very open, D and S quite broad.</p>
                                <locus from="line1" to="line1">Line 1</locus>
                                <dimensions type="letterHeight">
                                    <height unit="mm" atLeast="65" atMost="75">65-75</height>
                                </dimensions>
